# Aurelio's backend settings. Copy this file to backend/.env and fill in what
# you need: only OPENROUTER_API_KEY is needed, and only by the chat and the
# analysis. backend/.env is ignored by git; this template is not, so never put
# a real key in it.

# The gateway the chat and the analysis talk to: any OpenAI-compatible
# endpoint. By default OpenRouter (get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys);
# MiMo, DeepSeek, Kimi or a local server replace it with one line below.
# Put the real key only in backend/.env.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional: the gateway's OpenAI-compatible base URL.
# (default if empty: https://openrouter.ai/api/v1)
#
# Chinese providers, verified Oct 2026 (set the matching OPENROUTER_MODEL too):
#   MiMo (Xiaomi):   https://api.xiaomimimo.com/v1     model: mimo-v2.6-pro
#   DeepSeek:        https://api.deepseek.com/v1       model: deepseek-chat
#   Kimi (Moonshot): https://api.moonshot.cn/v1        model: kimi-k2.6
# Anything OpenAI-compatible works, including a local server (Ollama, vLLM).
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=

# Optional: the model's id on that gateway, as a slug from the provider's own
# list (default if empty: anthropic/claude-opus-5.5, on OpenRouter)
OPENROUTER_MODEL=

# Optional: give each role of the analysis its own model. Different models
# bring different blind spots, which is the point of a panel; leaving these
# empty runs every role on OPENROUTER_MODEL, and the analysis still works
# because the asymmetry is in the context each role receives, not in the
# weights.
#   analyst: judges the portfolio blind (quantitative work)
#   confidant: knows the person, never sees the figures (reads people, words)
# Slugs checked in Aug 2026: moonshotai/kimi-k3 ($3/$15 per 1M tokens, 1M ctx),
# moonshotai/kimi-k2.6 (about 6x cheaper), anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6.
# Checked in Oct 2026: anthropic/claude-opus-5.5 ($4/$20, 1M ctx),
# openai/gpt-6.1-sol-pro ($2/$10, 1.05M ctx), qwen/qwen3.8-max-0902 ($2/$6).
OPENROUTER_ANALYST_MODEL=
OPENROUTER_CONFIDANT_MODEL=

# Optional: the model the chat panel answers with when nothing is picked in its
# menu (falls back to OPENROUTER_MODEL). The default errs large, because a
# wrong number about your money costs more than a slow answer.
OPENROUTER_CHAT_MODEL=

# Optional: another SQLite database. Default: backend/data.db.
# ./start.ps1 -Demo and ./start.sh --demo point it at backend/demo.db for you.
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///path/to/another.db
